{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fr9huGpBG11795057332.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人彭偉新表示，港股大市成交持續偏少，市況不健康，恒指22,800點位置亦未必是強勁的支持位。</p><p></p><p>獨立股評人彭偉新指出：「我們要有較正面或健康的市況，跌下來要有支持，大市成交不可低於2,300億元水平。就算今天跌至23,000點位置，能企穩、就算略為反彈也好，投資者也不會加注買貨。22,800點這位置是否真的是很強的支持位？我覺得暫時還不是，除非有非常利好消息，可能市況才回復活躍。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.284991+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:15.373502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:17.819438+00:00","content_hash":"c3d19b506018e4373a585312123de798716ba031623cd927b7cf1720c11466f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.284991+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}